<title>USA: NBA BASKETBALL-WEDNESDAY'S PLAYOFF RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NBA BASKETBALL-WEDNESDAY'S PLAYOFF RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of first-round NBA</p>
<p>playoff games on Wednesday (home team in CAPS):</p>
<p>		  EASTERN CONFERENCE</p>
<p> Chicago	    96  WASHINGTON     95</p>
<p>(Chicago wins best-of-five series 3-0)</p>
<p>		 WESTERN CONFERENCE</p>
<p> PORTLAND	   98  La Lakers	90</p>
<p>(Los Angeles leads best-of-five series 2-1)</p>
</text>
